WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.700
The Third Category is Equity &
Representation.

2
00:00:03.880 --> 00:00:08.140
AI has a unique capacity to reproduce
existing social inequalities.

3
00:00:08.620 --> 00:00:11.960
A lack of diversity in training data can
harm minority groups,

4
00:00:12.140 --> 00:00:15.084
making concrete bias mitigation strategies
a requirement.
